lor":"ededed","default":false,"description":"Has detailed reproduction steps"},{"id":8223769668,"node_id":"LA_kwDON91aY88AAAAB6izERA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/labels/platform:linux","name":"platform:linux","color":"93A5FF","default":false,"description":"Issue specifically occurs on Linux"},{"id":8572719646,"node_id":"LA_kwDON91aY88AAAAB_vlSHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/labels/area:core","name":"area:core","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"dicksontsai","id":3757768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc3Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3757768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai","html_url":"https://github.com/dicksontsai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":24,"created_at":"2026-01-04T21:24:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T17:19:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"dicksontsai","id":3757768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc3Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3757768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai","html_url":"https://github.com/dicksontsai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicksontsai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\n\nHooks defined in an external `hooks.json` file referenced from a plugin's `plugin.json` are not being loaded or executed.\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Create a plugin with this structure:\n```\nmy-plugin/\n├── .claude-plugin/\n│   └── plugin.json\n└── hooks/\n    └── hooks.json\n```\n\n2. In `plugin.json`, reference the hooks file:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-plugin\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"hooks\": \"./hooks/hooks.json\"\n}\n```\n\n3. In `hooks/hooks.json`, define a hook:\n```json\n{\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"SubagentStop\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"*\",\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"command\",\n            \"command\": \"echo 'Hook fired' >> /tmp/hook-test.log\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n4. Install and enable the plugin\n5. Trigger a subagent (Task tool)\n6. Check `/tmp/hook-test.log` - **file does not exist**\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nThe hook should fire and write to the log file when a subagent completes.\n\n## Actual Behavior\n\nThe hook never fires. The log file is never created.\n\n## Workaround\n\nDefining the same hook directly in `~/.claude/settings.json` works correctly - the hook fires as expected. This confirms:\n- The hook event (SubagentStop) works\n- The hook command is valid\n- Only plugin-based hook discovery is broken\n\n## Environment\n\n- Claude Code version: Latest\n- OS: Linux (WSL2)\n- Plugin installed via marketplace","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/16288/reactions","total_count":19,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/16288/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}